  "Punctate or diffuse · {channel}": "点状か拡散か · {channel}",
  "Diffusivity is the stained area over the peak intensity: low for spots, high for a stain spread over the cell": "Diffusivity は染色面積をピーク強度で割った値。スポットでは低く、細胞全体に広がる染色では高い",
